WEBVTT

49:36.458 --> 49:38.293
Now, child...

49:39.336 --> 49:41.255
tell me what happened.

49:41.380 --> 49:43.423
Tell it all and tell it true.

49:43.549 --> 49:46.051
It's a great crime to lie to a king.

49:54.560 --> 49:56.728
I don't know.

49:56.853 --> 49:59.856
I don't remember.
Everything happened so fast.
